*> What a saved mob compound said about the aquatic keys of docs/protocol/45-entity-nbt-7 sections 3, 4 and 6, collected by AQUATIC7-NBT-KEY and applied by AQUATIC7-NBT-APPLY
*> (ENTITY-NBT-ONE hands the tadpole its Age and AgeLocked: A7-AGE and A7-LOCKED). A7-SALMON and A7-TROP are -1 when the compound does not hold the key.
 01 A7-DATA.
    05 A7-SALMON           PIC X(8).
    05 A7-PUFF             BINARY-LONG.
    05 A7-TROP             BINARY-LONG.
    05 A7-DARK             BINARY-LONG.
    05 A7-MOIST            BINARY-LONG.
    05 A7-AGE              BINARY-LONG.
    05 A7-LOCKED           BINARY-LONG.
